    "content" : "For details of this weak convergence, see Section 7, and more speciﬁcally Section 7.2. An analogous theorem is not known in the Rademacher case (and would involve non-trivial adjustments to the argument). For this reason, we do not give a proof of Theorem 1 in the Rademacher case."
